msgstr "用于具有确切来源身份和明确归属的环境记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/requestStateSuperseded|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring execution, authority, acceptance or global completeness from a source record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从来源记录推断执行、权威、接受或全局完备性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/requestStateSuperseded|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the provider, world, original source and recorded scope; preserve conflicting reports without defaults."
msgstr "保留提供方、世界、原始来源和所记录范围；保留冲突报告而不设默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/requestStateSuperseded|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this documented meaning: The source records replacement of the request by another revision or request. The original evidence is retained rather than erased."
msgstr "保留此有据可查的含义：来源记录已被另一修订或请求替代。原始证据得到保留，而非擦除。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tagReadable|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "readable object"
msgstr "可读对象"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tagReadable|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A source-supplied tag that an object is readable by the agent. Tagging does not prove the provider capability is available or authorize access."
msgstr "来源提供的标签，表示对象可由代理阅读。标记不证明提供方能力可用，也不授权访问。"

