msgstr "保留此有据可查的含义：将声明保留在具名所有者自身代理范围内、不向其他代理披露的姿态。所有者必须明确，不从提供方或记录者推断缺失所有者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/policyCourtRealm|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "named-circle disclosure"
msgstr "具名圈披露"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/policyCourtRealm|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A disclosure posture limiting release to an explicitly named, owner-maintained circle of agents. The retained consumer IRI denotes named circles, not a universal realm or permission inferred from a label."
msgstr "将披露限制于所有者维护的显式具名代理圈的姿态。保留的消费者 IRI 指代具名圈，而非通用领域或从标签推断的许可。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/policyCourtRealm|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
