msgid "Retain this documented meaning: A disclosure posture limiting release to an explicitly named, owner-maintained circle of agents. The retained consumer IRI denotes named circles, not a universal realm or permission inferred from a label."
msgstr "保留此有据可查的含义：将披露限制于所有者维护的显式具名代理圈的姿态。保留的消费者 IRI 指代具名圈，而非通用领域或从标签推断的许可。"

