msgid "The original date-time at which the environment reports first seeing the object. It is not a global first or a supersession ordering key."
msgstr "环境报告首次见到对象的原始日期时间。它不是全局首次时间，也不是取代关系的排序键。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/firstSeenAt|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
