msgid "Retain this documented meaning: The provider's original semantic-type code for which no WorldObjectKind was supplied. Keep the code unchanged rather than inventing a kind or identity."
msgstr "保留此有据可查的含义：提供方在未给出 WorldObjectKind 时的原始语义类型代码。保持代码不变，而不虚构种类或身份。"

