msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptanceText|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The accepting agent's original words, retaining language and direction when supplied. The statement is evidence of acceptance, not wording fabricated from fulfillment."
msgstr "接受代理的原始话语，保留已提供的语言与书写方向。该陈述是接受证据，而非从履行报告编造的措辞。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptanceText|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for an explicitly attributed environment record with exact source identities."
msgstr "用于具有确切来源身份和明确归属的环境记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptanceText|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring execution, authority, acceptance or global completeness from a source record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从来源记录推断执行、权威、接受或全局完备性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptanceText|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the provider, world, original source and recorded scope; preserve conflicting reports without defaults."
msgstr "保留提供方、世界、原始来源和所记录范围；保留冲突报告而不设默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/acceptanceText|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
