msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/requestRevisionDigest|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "answered request revision digest"
msgstr "所回应请求修订摘要"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/requestRevisionDigest|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The algorithm-tagged digest of the exact request revision an offer, fulfillment or acceptance answers. It must agree with that revision's own contentDigest, not hash the response."
msgstr "提议、履行或接受所回应的确切请求修订的带算法标记摘要。它必须与该修订自身的 contentDigest 一致，而非对回应计算哈希。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/requestRevisionDigest|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for an explicitly attributed environment record with exact source identities."
msgstr "用于具有确切来源身份和明确归属的环境记录。"

