msgstr "记录回应"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/recordsResponse|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A response record retained for this exact request revision. The link does not imply that acknowledgement fulfilled or settled it."
msgstr "为此确切请求修订保留的回应记录。此链接不隐含确认收到即已履行或解决请求。"

