msgstr "纠正转换证据"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/correctsTransition|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The original transition record corrected by this source-backed correction, without rewriting the original history."
msgstr "此有来源支持的纠正所修正的原始转换记录，不改写原始历史。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/correctsTransition|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
