msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldKindHierarchyAcyclicConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "world kind hierarchy acyclicity"
msgstr "世界种类层级无环性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldKindHierarchyAcyclicConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An everyday kind cannot reach itself through one or more broader-kind links. Multiple broader parents remain permitted."
msgstr "日常种类不能通过一个或多个更宽泛种类链接到达自身。仍允许多个更宽泛的父种类。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldKindHierarchyAcyclicConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency within the declared source scope."
msgstr "用于检查声明来源范围内的内在一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldKindHierarchyAcyclicConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this law executes a provider, verifies source bytes or grants disclosure permission."
msgstr "避免声称此定律执行提供方、核验来源字节或授予披露权限。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldKindHierarchyAcyclicConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the exact source evidence when diagnosing a violated obligation; never invent missing inputs."
msgstr "诊断违反义务时保留确切来源证据；绝不虚构缺失输入。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldKindHierarchyAcyclicConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:WorldKindHierarchyAcyclicConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:worldObjectKindBroader ."
msgstr "保留此支配定律：gmeow:WorldKindHierarchyAcyclicConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:worldObjectKindBroader ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldStateSupersessionAcyclicConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "world state supersession acyclicity"
msgstr "世界状态取代无环性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldStateSupersessionAcyclicConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A state claim cannot causally replace itself through a nonempty supersession path. The law orders replacement edges rather than source clocks."
msgstr "状态断言不能通过非空取代路径因果地替换自身。此定律排序取代边，而非来源时钟。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldStateSupersessionAcyclicConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency within the declared source scope."
msgstr "用于检查声明来源范围内的内在一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldStateSupersessionAcyclicConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this law executes a provider, verifies source bytes or grants disclosure permission."
msgstr "避免声称此定律执行提供方、核验来源字节或授予披露权限。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldStateSupersessionAcyclicConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the exact source evidence when diagnosing a violated obligation; never invent missing inputs."
msgstr "诊断违反义务时保留确切来源证据；绝不虚构缺失输入。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldStateSupersessionAcyclicConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:WorldStateSupersessionAcyclicConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:WorldObjectStateClaim ."
msgstr "保留此支配定律：gmeow:WorldStateSupersessionAcyclicConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:WorldObjectStateClaim ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldStateSupersessionScopeConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "world state supersession scope constraint"
msgstr "世界状态取代范围约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldStateSupersessionScopeConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A replaced state claim has the same object, provider, world and encoding profile as its successor. Different profiles or worlds require separate histories rather than a silent causal merge."
msgstr "被取代状态断言与其后继具有相同对象、提供方、世界和编码配置。不同配置或世界需要独立历史，而非悄然进行因果合并。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldStateSupersessionScopeConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency within the declared source scope."
msgstr "用于检查声明来源范围内的内在一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldStateSupersessionScopeConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this law executes a provider, verifies source bytes or grants disclosure permission."
msgstr "避免声称此定律执行提供方、核验来源字节或授予披露权限。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldStateSupersessionScopeConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the exact source evidence when diagnosing a violated obligation; never invent missing inputs."
msgstr "诊断违反义务时保留确切来源证据；绝不虚构缺失输入。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldStateSupersessionScopeConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:WorldStateSupersessionScopeConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:WorldObjectStateClaim ."
msgstr "保留此支配定律：gmeow:WorldStateSupersessionScopeConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:WorldObjectStateClaim ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldStateDigestAgreementConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "world state content digest agreement"
msgstr "世界状态内容摘要一致性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldStateDigestAgreementConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The meaningful-state digest is a contentDigest of the exact canonical state artifact. It is not the enclosing claim record's own byte digest."
msgstr "有意义状态摘要是确切规范状态制品的 contentDigest，而非外层断言记录自身字节的摘要。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldStateDigestAgreementConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency within the declared source scope."
msgstr "用于检查声明来源范围内的内在一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldStateDigestAgreementConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this law executes a provider, verifies source bytes or grants disclosure permission."
msgstr "避免声称此定律执行提供方、核验来源字节或授予披露权限。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldStateDigestAgreementConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the exact source evidence when diagnosing a violated obligation; never invent missing inputs."
msgstr "诊断违反义务时保留确切来源证据；绝不虚构缺失输入。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldStateDigestAgreementConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:WorldStateDigestAgreementConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:worldObjectState ."
msgstr "保留此支配定律：gmeow:WorldStateDigestAgreementConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:worldObjectState ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/StateEncodingProfileIdentityConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "state encoding profile identity"
msgstr "状态编码配置身份"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/StateEncodingProfileIdentityConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A selected canonical encoding profile retains its own artifact digest. The law preserves profile identity without executing an encoder or certifying canonical bytes."
msgstr "所选规范编码配置保留其自身制品摘要。此定律保留配置身份，而不执行编码器或证明字节的规范性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/StateEncodingProfileIdentityConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency within the declared source scope."
msgstr "用于检查声明来源范围内的内在一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/StateEncodingProfileIdentityConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
