msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:StateEncodingProfileIdentityConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:stateEncodingProfile ."
msgstr "保留此支配定律：gmeow:StateEncodingProfileIdentityConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:stateEncodingProfile ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/StateViewScopeConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "state view scope constraint"
msgstr "状态视图范围约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/StateViewScopeConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every state-view member shares that view's exact object, provider, world and encoding profile. Membership is bounded evidence, not global coverage."
msgstr "每个状态视图成员共享该视图的确切对象、提供方、世界和编码配置。成员关系是有界证据，而非全局覆盖。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/StateViewScopeConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency within the declared source scope."
msgstr "用于检查声明来源范围内的内在一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/StateViewScopeConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this law executes a provider, verifies source bytes or grants disclosure permission."
msgstr "避免声称此定律执行提供方、核验来源字节或授予披露权限。"

