msgstr "用 eventType eventTypeWorldObjectContractsUpgraded 分类实际 Event 或 Activity，并为精确来源陈述保留归属。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldObjectContractsUpgraded|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This is an EventType value for world object contracts upgraded, not an occurrence or an executable operation."
msgstr "这是“世界对象契约已升级”的 EventType 值，不是事件本身或可执行操作。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldObjectContractsUpgraded|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "For example: ex:occurrence a gmeow:Event ; gmeow:eventType gmeow:eventTypeWorldObjectContractsUpgraded ."
msgstr "例如：ex:occurrence a gmeow:Event ; gmeow:eventType gmeow:eventTypeWorldObjectContractsUpgraded ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldPlaceReference|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "world reference placement"
msgstr "世界引用放置"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldPlaceReference|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The source reports placing a reference at a location in the environment."
msgstr "来源报告将引用放置在环境某处。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldPlaceReference|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for the recorded world reference placement occurrence."
msgstr "用于已记录的“世界引用放置”事件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldPlaceReference|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Reference placement is not creation of its referent or verified access to it."
msgstr "放置引用不等于创建其指称对象或验证访问。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldPlaceReference|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Classify the actual Event or Activity with eventType eventTypeWorldPlaceReference; attribute the exact source statement."
msgstr "用 eventType eventTypeWorldPlaceReference 分类实际 Event 或 Activity，并为精确来源陈述保留归属。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldPlaceReference|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This is an EventType value for world reference placement, not an occurrence or an executable operation."
msgstr "这是“世界引用放置”的 EventType 值，不是事件本身或可执行操作。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldPlaceReference|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "For example: ex:occurrence a gmeow:Event ; gmeow:eventType gmeow:eventTypeWorldPlaceReference ."
msgstr "例如：ex:occurrence a gmeow:Event ; gmeow:eventType gmeow:eventTypeWorldPlaceReference ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldSetBedsideItems|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "world bedside items set"
msgstr "世界床边物品已设置"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldSetBedsideItems|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The source reports setting the objects placed at an agent's bedside."
msgstr "来源报告设置智能体床边放置的对象。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldSetBedsideItems|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for the recorded world bedside items set occurrence."
msgstr "用于已记录的“世界床边物品已设置”事件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldSetBedsideItems|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Record the actual items through affectsObject without inferring ownership or sleep."
msgstr "通过 affectsObject 记录实际物品，不推断所有权或睡眠。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldSetBedsideItems|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Classify the actual Event or Activity with eventType eventTypeWorldSetBedsideItems; attribute the exact source statement."
msgstr "用 eventType eventTypeWorldSetBedsideItems 分类实际 Event 或 Activity，并为精确来源陈述保留归属。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldSetBedsideItems|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This is an EventType value for world bedside items set, not an occurrence or an executable operation."
msgstr "这是“世界床边物品已设置”的 EventType 值，不是事件本身或可执行操作。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldSetBedsideItems|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "For example: ex:occurrence a gmeow:Event ; gmeow:eventType gmeow:eventTypeWorldSetBedsideItems ."
msgstr "例如：ex:occurrence a gmeow:Event ; gmeow:eventType gmeow:eventTypeWorldSetBedsideItems ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldProviderUpsert|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "world provider state upsert"
msgstr "世界提供方状态更新"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldProviderUpsert|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The source reports a provider announcing an object with changed meaningful state."
msgstr "来源报告提供方宣告有意义状态已改变的对象。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldProviderUpsert|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for the recorded world provider state upsert occurrence."
msgstr "用于已记录的“世界提供方状态更新”事件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldProviderUpsert|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Use the existing scoped state-claim spine; the event kind does not calculate a state digest."
msgstr "使用已有来源限定状态主张结构；事件类型不计算状态摘要。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldProviderUpsert|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Classify the actual Event or Activity with eventType eventTypeWorldProviderUpsert; attribute the exact source statement."
msgstr "用 eventType eventTypeWorldProviderUpsert 分类实际 Event 或 Activity，并为精确来源陈述保留归属。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldProviderUpsert|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This is an EventType value for world provider state upsert, not an occurrence or an executable operation."
msgstr "这是“世界提供方状态更新”的 EventType 值，不是事件本身或可执行操作。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldProviderUpsert|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "For example: ex:occurrence a gmeow:Event ; gmeow:eventType gmeow:eventTypeWorldProviderUpsert ."
msgstr "例如：ex:occurrence a gmeow:Event ; gmeow:eventType gmeow:eventTypeWorldProviderUpsert ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldProviderDegraded|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "world provider degraded"
msgstr "世界提供方退化"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldProviderDegraded|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The source reports an environment provider failing or becoming degraded."
msgstr "来源报告环境提供方失败或退化。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldProviderDegraded|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for the recorded world provider degraded occurrence."
msgstr "用于已记录的“世界提供方退化”事件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldProviderDegraded|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "One provider's failure does not prove every provider or the whole world unavailable."
msgstr "一个提供方失败不证明全部提供方或整个世界不可用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldProviderDegraded|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Classify the actual Event or Activity with eventType eventTypeWorldProviderDegraded; attribute the exact source statement."
msgstr "用 eventType eventTypeWorldProviderDegraded 分类实际 Event 或 Activity，并为精确来源陈述保留归属。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldProviderDegraded|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This is an EventType value for world provider degraded, not an occurrence or an executable operation."
msgstr "这是“世界提供方退化”的 EventType 值，不是事件本身或可执行操作。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldProviderDegraded|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "For example: ex:occurrence a gmeow:Event ; gmeow:eventType gmeow:eventTypeWorldProviderDegraded ."
msgstr "例如：ex:occurrence a gmeow:Event ; gmeow:eventType gmeow:eventTypeWorldProviderDegraded ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldProviderSuperseded|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "world provider superseded"
msgstr "世界提供方被替代"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldProviderSuperseded|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The source reports replacing an environment provider."
msgstr "来源报告替换环境提供方。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldProviderSuperseded|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for the recorded world provider superseded occurrence."
msgstr "用于已记录的“世界提供方被替代”事件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldProviderSuperseded|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Provider replacement preserves prior identity and reports; it is not sameAs or history deletion."
msgstr "替换保留原身份和报告，不是 sameAs 或删除历史。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldProviderSuperseded|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Classify the actual Event or Activity with eventType eventTypeWorldProviderSuperseded; attribute the exact source statement."
msgstr "用 eventType eventTypeWorldProviderSuperseded 分类实际 Event 或 Activity，并为精确来源陈述保留归属。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldProviderSuperseded|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This is an EventType value for world provider superseded, not an occurrence or an executable operation."
msgstr "这是“世界提供方被替代”的 EventType 值，不是事件本身或可执行操作。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldProviderSuperseded|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "For example: ex:occurrence a gmeow:Event ; gmeow:eventType gmeow:eventTypeWorldProviderSuperseded ."
msgstr "例如：ex:occurrence a gmeow:Event ; gmeow:eventType gmeow:eventTypeWorldProviderSuperseded ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldNotificationRecorded|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "world notice recorded"
msgstr "世界通知已记录"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldNotificationRecorded|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The source reports recording a notice intended for an agent."
msgstr "来源报告记录面向智能体的通知。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldNotificationRecorded|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for the recorded world notice recorded occurrence."
msgstr "用于已记录的“世界通知已记录”事件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldNotificationRecorded|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Recording a notice does not establish dispatch, attempt or delivery."
msgstr "记录通知不证明发送、尝试或送达。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldNotificationRecorded|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Classify the actual Event or Activity with eventType eventTypeWorldNotificationRecorded; attribute the exact source statement."
msgstr "用 eventType eventTypeWorldNotificationRecorded 分类实际 Event 或 Activity，并为精确来源陈述保留归属。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldNotificationRecorded|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This is an EventType value for world notice recorded, not an occurrence or an executable operation."
msgstr "这是“世界通知已记录”的 EventType 值，不是事件本身或可执行操作。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldNotificationRecorded|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "For example: ex:occurrence a gmeow:Event ; gmeow:eventType gmeow:eventTypeWorldNotificationRecorded ."
msgstr "例如：ex:occurrence a gmeow:Event ; gmeow:eventType gmeow:eventTypeWorldNotificationRecorded ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldNotificationDelivery|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "world notice delivery occurrence"
msgstr "世界通知投递事件"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldNotificationDelivery|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The source reports a notice-delivery occurrence, which may be an attempt or actual delivery."
msgstr "来源报告通知投递事件，可能是尝试或实际送达。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldNotificationDelivery|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for the recorded world notice delivery occurrence."
msgstr "用于已记录的世界通知投递事件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldNotificationDelivery|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Retain noticeDeliveryState separately; the event kind alone does not prove receipt."
msgstr "单独保留 noticeDeliveryState；仅事件类型不证明接收。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldNotificationDelivery|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Classify the actual Event or Activity with eventType eventTypeWorldNotificationDelivery; attribute the exact source statement."
msgstr "用 eventType eventTypeWorldNotificationDelivery 分类实际 Event 或 Activity，并为精确来源陈述保留归属。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldNotificationDelivery|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This is an EventType value for world notice delivery occurrence, not an occurrence or an executable operation."
msgstr "这是“世界通知投递事件”的 EventType 值，不是事件本身或可执行操作。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/eventTypeWorldNotificationDelivery|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "For example: ex:occurrence a gmeow:Event ; gmeow:eventType gmeow:eventTypeWorldNotificationDelivery ."
msgstr "例如：ex:occurrence a gmeow:Event ; gmeow:eventType gmeow:eventTypeWorldNotificationDelivery ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/messageKindWorldNotice|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "world notice message"
msgstr "世界通知消息"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/messageKindWorldNotice|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A communicative notice intended by an environment for an agent within it. The Message kind records purpose without asserting dispatch or receipt."
msgstr "环境面向其中智能体的通信通知。该 Message 种类记录用途，不声称发送或接收。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/messageKindWorldNotice|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for a retained environment notice, including one not yet sent."
msgstr "用于保留的环境通知，包括尚未发送的通知。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/messageKindWorldNotice|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating a notice artifact as its delivery Event or as proof of its content."
msgstr "避免将通知制品视为投递 Event 或其内容证明。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/messageKindWorldNotice|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Classify the actual Message through hasMessageKind and retain noticeKind and delivery reports independently."
msgstr "通过 hasMessageKind 分类实际 Message，并独立保留 noticeKind 和投递报告。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/messageKindWorldNotice|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This kind overlaps other MessageKind values without forcing email semantics."
msgstr "该种类可与其他 MessageKind 值重叠，不强制电子邮件语义。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/messageKindWorldNotice|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "For example: ex:notice a gmeow:Message ; gmeow:hasMessageKind gmeow:messageKindWorldNotice ."
msgstr "例如：ex:notice a gmeow:Message ; gmeow:hasMessageKind gmeow:messageKindWorldNotice ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NoticeKind|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Notice Kind"
msgstr "通知种类"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NoticeKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An open vocabulary for the reported topic of an environment notice."
msgstr "环境通知所报告主题的开放词汇表。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NoticeKind|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to classify notice kind values supplied by a source."
msgstr "用于分类来源提供的“通知种类”值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NoticeKind|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid replacing NoticeKind individuals with event or object subclasses."
msgstr "避免用事件或对象子类替代 NoticeKind 个体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NoticeKind|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Attach a typed value through noticeKind; keep independent attributed classifications."
msgstr "通过 noticeKind 附加已分类的值，保留独立归属的分类。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NoticeKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The notice kind vocabulary stays open; absence supplies no default member."
msgstr "“通知种类”词汇表保持开放，缺失值不提供默认成员。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NoticeKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "For example: ex:localValue a gmeow:NoticeKind ."
msgstr "例如：ex:localValue a gmeow:NoticeKind ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKind|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "notice kind"
msgstr "通知种类"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Relates a Message notice to its source-reported environment topic."
msgstr "将通知 Message 关联到来源报告的环境主题。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKind|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for the topic of an actual environment notice."
msgstr "用于实际环境通知的主题。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKind|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating notice content as verified fulfillment, recovery or delivery."
msgstr "避免把通知内容视为已验证履行、恢复或送达。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKind|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Classify the Message with hasMessageKind messageKindWorldNotice and retain supplied NoticeKind values."
msgstr "用 hasMessageKind messageKindWorldNotice 分类 Message，并保留已提供 NoticeKind。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Topics may overlap; no preferred topic or missing-field default is supplied."
msgstr "主题可重叠，不提供首选主题或缺失字段默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "For example: ex:notice a gmeow:Message ; gmeow:hasMessageKind gmeow:messageKindWorldNotice ; gmeow:noticeKind gmeow:noticeKindGiftOffered ."
msgstr "例如：ex:notice a gmeow:Message ; gmeow:hasMessageKind gmeow:messageKindWorldNotice ; gmeow:noticeKind gmeow:noticeKindGiftOffered ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKindGiftOffered|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "gift offered notice"
msgstr "赠礼提议通知"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKindGiftOffered|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The notice reports a gift offered to an agent."
msgstr "通知报告向智能体提出赠礼。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKindGiftOffered|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for the source's explicit gift offered notice classification."
msgstr "用于来源明确的“赠礼提议通知”分类。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKindGiftOffered|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "An offer is not acceptance, possession or completed delivery."
msgstr "提议不等于接受、占有或已完成投递。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKindGiftOffered|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference this NoticeKind individual through noticeKind, retaining the exact claim's source context."
msgstr "通过 noticeKind 引用此 NoticeKind 个体，并保留精确主张的来源情境。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKindGiftOffered|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This gift offered notice value is not a default, an executable transition or a current-state winner."
msgstr "“赠礼提议通知”值不是默认值、可执行转换或胜出的当前状态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKindGiftOffered|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "For example: ex:record gmeow:noticeKind gmeow:noticeKindGiftOffered ."
msgstr "例如：ex:record gmeow:noticeKind gmeow:noticeKindGiftOffered ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKindRequestCreated|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "request created notice"
msgstr "请求创建通知"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKindRequestCreated|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The notice reports recording an agent's request."
msgstr "通知报告记录智能体的请求。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKindRequestCreated|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for the source's explicit request created notice classification."
msgstr "用于来源明确的“请求创建通知”分类。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKindRequestCreated|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Request recording does not establish fulfillment or a commitment to act."
msgstr "记录请求不证明履行或承诺行动。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKindRequestCreated|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference this NoticeKind individual through noticeKind, retaining the exact claim's source context."
msgstr "通过 noticeKind 引用此 NoticeKind 个体，并保留精确主张的来源情境。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKindRequestCreated|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This request created notice value is not a default, an executable transition or a current-state winner."
msgstr "“请求创建通知”值不是默认值、可执行转换或胜出的当前状态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKindRequestCreated|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
