msgstr "撤回保留原请求，不证明所请求工作从未发生。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKindRequestWithdrawn|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference this NoticeKind individual through noticeKind, retaining the exact claim's source context."
msgstr "通过 noticeKind 引用此 NoticeKind 个体，并保留精确主张的来源情境。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKindRequestWithdrawn|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
