msgstr "“请求撤回通知”值不是默认值、可执行转换或胜出的当前状态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKindRequestWithdrawn|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "For example: ex:record gmeow:noticeKind gmeow:noticeKindRequestWithdrawn ."
msgstr "例如：ex:record gmeow:noticeKind gmeow:noticeKindRequestWithdrawn ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKindWorldDegraded|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
