msgstr "用于来源明确的“世界退化通知”分类。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKindWorldDegraded|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "The notice is not itself the environment transition or a verified health measurement."
msgstr "通知本身不是环境转换或已验证健康测量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKindWorldDegraded|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference this NoticeKind individual through noticeKind, retaining the exact claim's source context."
msgstr "通过 noticeKind 引用此 NoticeKind 个体，并保留精确主张的来源情境。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKindWorldDegraded|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This world degraded notice value is not a default, an executable transition or a current-state winner."
msgstr "“世界退化通知”值不是默认值、可执行转换或胜出的当前状态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKindWorldDegraded|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "For example: ex:record gmeow:noticeKind gmeow:noticeKindWorldDegraded ."
msgstr "例如：ex:record gmeow:noticeKind gmeow:noticeKindWorldDegraded ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKindWorldRecovered|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "world recovered notice"
msgstr "世界恢复通知"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKindWorldRecovered|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The notice reports recovery from a degraded environment state."
msgstr "通知报告环境从退化状态恢复。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKindWorldRecovered|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for the source's explicit world recovered notice classification."
msgstr "用于来源明确的“世界恢复通知”分类。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKindWorldRecovered|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Retain the source's recovery claim without inferring permanent health."
msgstr "保留来源恢复主张，不推断永久健康。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKindWorldRecovered|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference this NoticeKind individual through noticeKind, retaining the exact claim's source context."
msgstr "通过 noticeKind 引用此 NoticeKind 个体，并保留精确主张的来源情境。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKindWorldRecovered|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This world recovered notice value is not a default, an executable transition or a current-state winner."
msgstr "“世界恢复通知”值不是默认值、可执行转换或胜出的当前状态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeKindWorldRecovered|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "For example: ex:record gmeow:noticeKind gmeow:noticeKindWorldRecovered ."
msgstr "例如：ex:record gmeow:noticeKind gmeow:noticeKindWorldRecovered ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NoticeDeliveryState|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Notice Delivery State"
msgstr "通知投递状态"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NoticeDeliveryState|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An open vocabulary for a notice's or one delivery attempt's reported recipient-reaching state."
msgstr "通知或单次投递尝试所报告接收状态的开放词汇表。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NoticeDeliveryState|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to classify notice delivery state values supplied by a source."
msgstr "用于分类来源提供的“通知投递状态”值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NoticeDeliveryState|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid replacing NoticeDeliveryState individuals with event or object subclasses."
msgstr "避免用事件或对象子类替代 NoticeDeliveryState 个体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NoticeDeliveryState|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Attach a typed value through noticeDeliveryState; keep independent attributed classifications."
msgstr "通过 noticeDeliveryState 附加已分类的值，保留独立归属的分类。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NoticeDeliveryState|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The notice delivery state vocabulary stays open; absence supplies no default member."
msgstr "“通知投递状态”词汇表保持开放，缺失值不提供默认成员。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NoticeDeliveryState|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "For example: ex:localValue a gmeow:NoticeDeliveryState ."
msgstr "例如：ex:localValue a gmeow:NoticeDeliveryState ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeDeliveryState|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "notice delivery state"
msgstr "通知投递状态"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeDeliveryState|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The reported recipient-reaching state of a notice Message or one actual delivery Activity, keeping separate attempts distinct."
msgstr "通知 Message 或单次实际投递 Activity 所报告的到达接收者状态，区分各次尝试。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeDeliveryState|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for an explicit delivery report, including explicit uncertainty."
msgstr "用于明确投递报告，包括显式不确定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeDeliveryState|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid applying one attempt's result to all attempts or inferring delivery from event typing."
msgstr "避免将一次尝试结果应用于全部尝试，或从事件类型推断已送达。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeDeliveryState|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Use a Message notice or a delivery Activity linked by affectsObject to the actual notice."
msgstr "使用通知 Message 或通过 affectsObject 关联实际通知的投递 Activity。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeDeliveryState|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "A property-guarded native law checks the union carrier and attempt binding; no seed value is a default."
msgstr "属性守卫原生规则检查联合载体和尝试绑定；初始值均不是默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeDeliveryState|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "For example: ex:delivery a gmeow:Activity ; gmeow:eventType gmeow:eventTypeWorldNotificationDelivery ; gmeow:affectsObject ex:notice ; gmeow:noticeDeliveryState gmeow:noticeDeliveryStateAttempted ."
msgstr "例如：ex:delivery a gmeow:Activity ; gmeow:eventType gmeow:eventTypeWorldNotificationDelivery ; gmeow:affectsObject ex:notice ; gmeow:noticeDeliveryState gmeow:noticeDeliveryStateAttempted ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeDeliveryStatePending|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "notice delivery pending"
msgstr "通知投递待定"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeDeliveryStatePending|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The source reports the notice not yet delivered in this delivery context."
msgstr "来源报告通知在此投递情境中尚未送达。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/noticeDeliveryStatePending|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
